  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Calculating sines,cosines and tangents of acute angles using a calculator</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Using a calculator, calculate the sine, cosine, and tangent of \({@angle@}^\circ\), giving your answers correct to exactly 4 decimal places.</p>

<p>i. \(\sin({@angle@}^\circ) =\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]][[feedback:prt1]]</p>
<p>ii. \(\cos({@angle@}^\circ) =\) [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]][[feedback:prt2]]</p>
<p>iii. \(\tan({@angle@}^\circ) =\) [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]][[feedback:prt3]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Worked Solution:</strong></p>

<p>Using a calculator, we evaluate the trigonometric functions for \({@angle@}^\circ\) and round each result to exactly 4 decimal places:</p>

<ul>
    <li>\(\sin({@angle@}^\circ) = {@disp_1@}\)</li>
    <li>\(\cos({@angle@}^\circ) = {@disp_2@}\)</li>
    <li>\(\tan({@angle@}^\circ) = {@disp_3@}\)</li>
</ul>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
